From ca12c0fc40bb6155fd13b86ee7c80af14b662463 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: starbite <starbite@local>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 15:30:55 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] port: rebase board MASTER configs on xnu-12377

MASTER.arm64.{sweet,a5xelte,herolte,starlte}: three-way merged onto
12377's MacOSX config (base = 11417 MacOSX). Board delta unchanged
(config_pmap_ppl + nos_arm_asm nos_arm_pmap in KERNEL_BASE instead of
12377's ARM_EXTRAS_BASE, no SPTM/exclaves). Taken from 12377: release
option in KERNEL_RELEASE, config_ucoredump, config_memory_microstackshot;
config_nexus_monitor, config_mbuf_jumbo, config_ledger_interval_max,
pgzalloc and CONFIG_HYPERVISOR_PUBLIC are gone upstream.
---
 config/MASTER.arm64.a5xelte | 25 +++++++++++++------------
 config/MASTER.arm64.herolte | 25 +++++++++++++------------
 config/MASTER.arm64.starlte | 25 +++++++++++++------------
 config/MASTER.arm64.sweet   | 25 +++++++++++++------------
 4 files changed, 52 insertions(+), 48 deletions(-)

